{"id":"u-682ab747-4053-4b3d-9a2d-fc34b951e559","src":"community","title":"My Magic Is Never Giving Up","author":"Splatterbox","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/iAgSRH-my-magic-is-never-giving-up","desc":"My magic is never giving up.\n\nSystem:\n\nUpper, lower, full body.\n\nYour upper and lower days are heavy. Doubles and triples. Whatever your 2rm max is. Burn out at 70-80 percent max on the last set. Your full body day is about going to failure in the 8-10 range. If you can do all sets at 10 reps, your weight is too low.\n\nEvery upper body set you fail is 10 push-ups after the workout. If you fail on the second set, you'll probably fail the 3 sets after, too. 40 push-ups. Every lower body set failed is a 0.5km run. \n\nSo you were not born with a lot of natural talent, huh? Well, you just work hard. That is your gift. That is your ninja way. Never apologize for trying hard, it is an insult to your determination.\n\nFail. Try again. Fail again. Lose, lose, lose, lose, win, lose, lose, lose, win, lose, win, lose, win, win, lose, win, win, win, win, win, win, win...\n\nSuccess comes to those who will do anything to achieve it.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-05-16T21:09:23.862Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"x":3},{"r":2,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"x":3},{"r":5},{"r":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":3},{"r":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":5}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5},{"r":3},{"r":1}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","